 "changelog": "Three fixes from your Windows test of v1.7.1: (1) Scanning no longer times out - the scan now runs asynchronously and its result arrives whenever it is ready, so the scan counter cannot get stuck at 0 with a 'Backend did not reply in time' error. (2) The green ring no longer drifts away from the mouse - it is placed at the exact cursor position every tick, with no nudging or accumulated offset. (3) The leftover Simple Clicker feature is removed completely - the stop shortcut (F7 by default) now only stops, nothing else toggles.",
